  {
    "scene": "what",
    "type": "what",
    "estimated_duration": 10,
    "text": "有个 2007 年的老工具，能让终端会话永不掉线。它叫 tmux，一个终端复用器。一个屏幕能开多个终端，可以 detach 退到后台，再 reattach 恢复。ISC 许可，现在到了 3.7。",
    "emotion": "build",
    "emotion_intensity": 0.45,
    "humor_type": null,
    "character_expression": null,
